<title>SINGAPORE: Indonesia to shut Balikpapan CDU from July 10.</title>
<headline>Indonesia to shut Balikpapan CDU from July 10.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's state-owned Pertamina will shut down a 200,000-barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit (CDU) at the Balikpapan refinery for one month maintenance beginning July 10, company sources said on Monday.  </p>
<p>&quot;There has been no changes to the schedule,&quot; one source told Reuters.</p>
<p>The CDU is the bigger of two crude units at the 265,000-bpd refinery located in Kalimantan on Borneo island.</p>
<p>The other 65,000-bpd CDU will operate normally, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
</text>
